{
  "name": "Poly/ML",
  "description": "Poly/ML is a high-performance implementation of the Standard ML (SML'97) language, providing a sophisticated native-code compiler alongside a portable bytecode interpreter. The system features a multi-threaded runtime environment with a parallel garbage collector and an extensive foreign function interface (FFI) for C interoperability. It is optimized for large-scale symbolic computation, serving as the primary execution engine for major interactive theorem provers like Isabelle and HOL.",
